## Category boundaries

When configured:

- architecture contains durable system structure and accepted decisions;
- development contains repository setup and contributor guidance;
- operations contains actionable runbooks and recovery procedures;
- release or releases contains release-specific material supplied by a
  release piece;
- archive contains superseded material that retains historical value.

Additional categories must define one clear purpose in their category index.
Decision records live under /{{docs.root}}/{docs.decisionRecordLocation}/.
